contract Types
parties we

record Bill
  amount HKD
  fee USD
  size TB
  count number
  term 3 months
  note text

can bill by we
  requires amount + fee > HKD 0
  requires size > 2 items
  requires term > 30 days
  requires note < "a"
  requires amount
  requires amount = 7
  requires count = 1.5
  requires amount > HKD 0.001
  requires count > 10000000000000000000
  requires amount / 0 > HKD 1
  requires count in (1, "a")
  requires (monthly 5) = 0
  requires 5% < 0.00001%
